'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[Medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Superstore#Permanent_Catalog|Permanent Catalog]] on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|250|notext}} and 125 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Siege-Ready}}

== Trivia ==
* This set of armor, along with the [[Thundering Hooves of Loyalty]] cape and player card set, was most likely introduced to commemorate the Chinese New Year of 2026 which is the Year of the Horse.
* The Armory description for this armor is a reference to the [[Wikipedia:Nian|nian]] in Chinese mythology.

==Issues==
SR is generally the designation for armors with the Siege Ready passive, not DP, which should be reserved for [[Democracy Protects]] armors.

